  saved as celltypist_v2_Basic_celltype_information.xlsx; sha256 8f89dcb8baf917595ca2eb16937b8c5afe1e4cd86651a61508fb0445f52964f7

Curated markers of the CellTypist Pan Immune Atlas v2 cell types (Dominguez Conde et al. 2022, Science 376:eabl5197).
Sheet "Main": 98 low-hierarchy cell types, columns High-hierarchy cell types, Low-hierarchy cell types, Description,
Cell Ontology ID, Curated markers (three per type). Two symbols are corrected when read (config.py, MARKER_FIX); the file
is used unchanged.
